, 2026</span></li><li class=""><a href="/blog?page=today-news&amp;blogid=69571f26c1784f0597fb0010">  Respected <nobr>Comrade</nobr> <nobr><bdo style='font-size:17px!important'>Kim Jong Un</bdo></nobr> receives greetings from emir of State of Kuwait</a><span>January 2, 2026</span></li><li class=""><a href="/blog?page=today-news&amp;blogid=69571f30c1784f0597fb0011">Respected <nobr>Comrade</nobr> <nobr><bdo style='font-size:17px!important'>Kim Jong Un</bdo></nobr> receives New Year’s cards from foreign state and party leaders</a><span>January 2, 2026</span></li><li class=""><a href="/blog?page=today-news&amp;blogid=69571f3bc1784f0597fb0012">Flower baskets sent to statues of great leaders from abroad</a><span>January 2, 2026</span></li><li class=""><a href="/blog?page=today-news&amp;blogid=69571f49c1784f0597fb0013">National flag-hoisting ceremony held to mark New Year</a><span>January 2, 2026</span></li><li class=""><a href="/blog?page=today-news&amp;blogid=69571f55c1784f0597fb0014">  Evening gala of youth and students held</a><span>January 2, 2026</span></li><li class=""><a href="/blog?page=today-news&amp;blogid=69571f61c1784f0597fb0015">  New hospitals start operation</a><span>January 2, 2026</span></li><li class=""><a href="/blog?page=today-news&amp;blogid=695728ffc1784f0597fb0016">New public and production buildings erected at farm in Kaesong  </a><span>January 2, 2026</span></li><li class=""><a href="/blog?page=today-news&amp;blogid=6957290bc1784f0597fb0017">Russian FM spokeswoman condemns US’ hostility toward Venezuela</a><span>January 2, 2026</span></li></ul><div class="advertlist"><div class="pagination"><a href="/blog?page=today-news&amp;num=1">Previous</a><div class="display"><span class="current">1</span><span>/</span><span class="total">1</span></div><a href="/blog?page=today-news&amp;num=1">Next</a></div></div></aside><article class="article"><h3 class="title" style="background-color:">Respected <nobr>Comrade</nobr> <nobr><bdo style='font-size:21px!important'>Kim Jong Un</bdo></nobr> receives congratulatory letter from Chongryon Central Standing Committee</h3><span class="date">January 2, 2026</span><div class="content"><p>The respected <nobr>Comrade</nobr> <nobr><bdo style='font-size:16px!important'>Kim Jong Un</bdo></nobr> received a congratulatory letter from the Central Standing Committee of the General Association of Korean Residents in Japan (Chongryon) on January 1.</p><p>The letter said that the Chongryon Central Standing Committee paid the deepest tribute to the great President <nobr><bdo style='font-size:16px!important'>Kim Il Sung</bdo></nobr> and the great General <nobr><bdo style='font-size:16px!important'>Kim Jong Il</bdo></nobr> on the first morning of the historic New Year 2026 when the Ninth Congress of the Workers' Party of Korea is to be held, and extended the highest glory and warmest congratulations to the respected Marshal <nobr><bdo style='font-size:16px!important'>Kim Jong Un</bdo></nobr> in reflection of the boundless reverence and loyalty of all the Chongryon officials and other Koreans in Japan.</p><p>The respected Marshal has ushered in a new era of building up the national power and enhancing the national prestige, to be specially recorded in the history of the development of the DPRK, opened up a heyday in the development of its armed forces and firmly defended the sovereignty of the country and wellbeing of its people, it noted.</p><p>It said that he personally sent a letter "Let Us Write a New Great Chapter in the History of the Movement of Koreans in Japan by Carrying forward the Patriotic Spirit of the Founder Generation" on the occasion of the 70th birthday of Chongryon to provide it with the strategy for invincibility and a grand blueprint for strengthening it, which enables it to ensure the eternal continuity of its glorious patriotic history characterized by the traditions of loyalty, unity and patriotism pioneered by the generation of the founders of Chongryon.</p><p>It stated that last year he sent Chongryon a huge amount of money as educational aid fund and stipend for the Korean children in Japan and invited a number of delegations and groups to the homeland, and showed such fatherly love as enabling Korean students in Japan to take part in the art performance for celebrating the New Year 2026.</p><p>The letter expressed the pledge to go all out for implementing the three-point key undertakings, set forth in the important letter sent by <nobr><bdo style='font-size:16px!important'>Kim Jong Un</bdo></nobr> on the occasion of the 70th birthday of Chongryon, by keeping pace with the ever-soaring working spirit and morale of the socialist homeland that will enter a new phase of transformation with the Ninth Congress of the WPK as a momentum, so as to effect a new upsurge in the patriotic movement for safeguarding the rights and interests of Koreans in Japan, bringing up the rising generations to be robust and firmly preserving the national identity of the Korean community.</p></div><p class="editor">KCNA</p></article></div><footer><div class="container"><div class="about left"><img src="/public/images/golden-mark.png" class="golden-mark" alt="golden-mark"/><p class="msg">The Pyongyang Times, launched on May 6, 1965, is the DPRK&#x27;s only English newspaper. It gives latest, detailed information about what is going on in the country in politics, the economy, culture and other sectors. And the paper also provides a vast knowledge of the nooks and crannies of Pyongyang.</p></div><div class="right"><div class="gallery"><h3>GALLERY</h3><a href="/multimedia?page=photo">Photographs</a><a href="/multimedia?page=video">Videos</a><a href="/multimedia?page=advertisement">Advertisement</a><a target="__blank" href="/contentsundefined">PDF Printing</a></div><div class="contact"><h3>CONTACT US</h3><span class="phone"><svg class="MuiSvgIcon-root" focusable="false" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M16 1H8C6.34 1 5 2.34 5 4v16c0 1.66 1.34 3 3 3